  "source_level_rationale": "Created contemporaneously by the Swiss National Council as an official transcript of parliamentary proceedings.",
  "resume": "This record documents a parliamentary question posed by National Councillor Philipp Hadorn to the Federal Housing Office in Grenchen during the 2018 spring session of the Swiss National Council, questioning whether the demonstrated need for housing is secure given threats to the office's future. It is a verbatim transcript of the question and response within the official session protocol. The session was recorded and archived as part of the National Council's official proceedings."
 },
